  "reason": "Existing evidence shows RNA-only multiprofile models with scvi_n200 encoder and avgpool aggregation achieve the highest accuracy (0.653). This experiment tests whether adding image data (resnet50) to this strong RNA-only baseline improves performance, isolating the effect of multimodal integration. It directly extends the most promising RNA-only configuration, balancing exploitation of known strengths with exploration of multimodal potential. The choice avoids changing multiple factors simultaneously and focuses on a critical design decision: whether image modality enhances performance when RNA is already optimized."
}

